    "what_this_identifies": "the departure LEVEL the world was running at -- `year_level_anchor` for every year inside the published switching record, fitted and declared alike. Two runs sharing this digest ran over the same departure surface; two that do not are different worlds however close their timestamps, and no figure from one bounds a figure from the other.",
